{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261022/photo/bkn-20261022231454162-1022_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261022234017\"/><p>行動中多名內地女子被捕。</p><p>元朗區警員聯同相關部門人員今日（22日）於區內展開代號「火石」的打擊非法賣淫活動行動。行動中，人員共拘捕24名內地女子，年齡介乎27至57歲，涉嫌「違反逗留條件」。所有被捕人現正被扣留調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T17:20:37.310470+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T15:14:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T17:18:10.266756+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T17:18:10.266756+00:00","content_hash":"000774427b907c76ad2d629ad97ce71677aafbc1acb0ef29aa74d0844a8eae54","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}